---
import Base from "../../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="勾花网围栏 — 规格、价格与安平工厂" description="镀锌与包塑勾花网围栏，用于体育场、安防及农场。菱形网孔尺寸、丝径规格，安平工厂直供。" lang="zh">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0 prose">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-theme-primary">勾花网围栏</h1>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">勾花网围栏 — 又称菱形网围栏 — 由镀锌钢丝编织成菱形网孔。安平工厂大量供应，用于体育场、学校、仓库、工地、农场及安防周界。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">材质与表面处理</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>丝径</th><th>镀层</th><th>寿命</th><th>适用场景</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>电镀锌</td><td>1.5–4.0mm</td><td>7–15 g/m² 锌</td><td>2–5 年</td><td>临时 / 室内</td></tr>
          <tr><td>热镀锌</td><td>2.0–5.0mm</td><td>40–60 g/m² 锌</td><td>8–15 年</td><td>体育 / 安防</td></tr>
          <tr><td>包塑（PVC）</td><td>2.0–4.0mm 芯丝</td><td>镀锌丝外包塑料</td><td>10–20 年</td><td>公园 / 学校</td></tr>
          <tr><td>预涂塑（PPVC）</td><td>2.0–4.0mm</td><td>编织前预涂塑</td><td>12–25 年</td><td>高端项目</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常用规格</h2>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>网孔 (mm)</th><th>丝径 (mm)</th><th>高度 (m)</th><th>长度 (m)</th><th>用途</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>40×40</td><td>2.0–2.5</td><td>0.9–2.4</td><td>10–25</td><td>住宅 / 园林</td></tr>
          <tr><td>50×50</td><td>2.5–3.0</td><td>1.2–3.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>体育场 / 学校</td></tr>
          <tr><td>55×55</td><td>2.5–3.5</td><td>1.2–3.6</td><td>10–25</td><td>标准安防</td></tr>
          <tr><td>60×60</td><td>3.0–4.0</td><td>1.5–4.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>工业 / 仓库</td></tr>
          <tr><td>75×75</td><td>3.0–5.0</td><td>1.8–4.5</td><td>10–25</td><td>公路 / 农场</td></tr>
          <tr><td>100×100</td><td>3.5–5.0</td><td>2.0–5.0</td><td>10–25</td><td>重型周界</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted">勾花网按卷（通常 10–25m）或平方米计价。<a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">估算重量 →</a></p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">订货时需要说明</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>网孔尺寸（mm，菱形孔）</li>
        <li>丝径和表面处理类型</li>
        <li>卷高和卷长</li>
        <li>是否含立柱、配件及张力丝</li>
        <li>包塑颜色（绿、黑、蓝为标准色）</li>
        <li>总数量（m² 或卷数）</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">价格参考</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格范围 (USD/m²)</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">起订量</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">电镀锌勾花网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm，2.5mm 丝，1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3.5–6.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10–15 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">热镀锌勾花网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm，3.0mm 丝，1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$5.0–8.5/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">12–18 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">包塑勾花网（绿色）</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm，3.0mm 芯丝，1.8m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$6.5–11.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15–20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">重型安防勾花网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">60×60mm，4.0mm 丝，2.4m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8.0–14.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">300 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">18–25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">体育场勾花网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×50mm，3.0mm 丝，4.0m×25m</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$7.0–12.0/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20–30 天</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted mb-6">*2025–2026 年参考价格。实际价格取决于镀锌量、钢丝成本、订单量及配件。请务必索取正式报价。</p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-theme-primary">常见问题</h2>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">标准围栏高度是多少？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">住宅：1.2–1.8m。体育场：3.0–4.0m。工业安防：2.4–3.6m。公路及重型周界：3.0–5.0m。定制高度可达 6m，需更粗丝径。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">镀锌和包塑哪个更好？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">热镀锌是标准选择，兼顾耐用与成本。包塑增加美观和额外防腐，但贵 30–50%。沿海或高湿地区选包塑或高尔凡丝。临时工地围栏用电镀锌即可。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">需要立柱和配件吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">需要 — 勾花网需要终端柱、中间柱、顶杆、张力丝及配件才能安装。多数安平工厂供应含立柱和配件的成套系统。说明立柱直径、壁厚，以及立柱是热镀锌还是喷漆。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">安防和体育分别用什么网孔？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">安防：50×50mm 或 60×60mm，3.0mm+ 丝径，防攀爬防剪断。体育：50×50mm 标准拦球。农场：75×75mm 或 100×100mm，更粗丝径防动物。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">能在顶部加刺丝或刀片刺绳吗？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">可以 — 很多工厂供应带刺丝延长臂或刀片刺绳支架的勾花网。说明刺丝类型（单股或双股）及刀片类型（如刀片刺绳）。</p>
      </details>
      
      <details class="mb-3 border border-theme rounded-lg bg-theme-card">
        <summary class="font-semibold cursor-pointer p-4 text-theme-primary hover:text-theme-accent transition">如何计算项目总成本？</summary>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 px-4 pb-4 text-theme-secondary">围栏面积（长 × 高）计算网片成本。加立柱（每 2.5–3m 一根）、顶杆、张力丝、大门及配件。使用我们的<a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-accent">FOB 价格计算器</a>估算到岸成本。</p>
      </details>

      <div class="not-prose mt-8 bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded-xl p-6">
        <p class="font-semibold text-lg">获取安平勾花网围栏工厂报价</p>
        <a href="/zh/inquiry/" class="inline-block mt-3 accent-bg hover:accent-bg font-semibold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg transition-colors">发送询盘 →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="lg:w-80 shrink-0">
      <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
        <!-- Quick Tools -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快捷工具</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">计算与换算</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/woven-wire-mesh-weight-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 重量计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/container-loading-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 集装箱装载计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/fob-price-calculator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> FOB 价格计算器
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/tools/inquiry-template-generator/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 询盘模板生成器
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Specs -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">快速规格</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">勾花网标准</h3>
          <dl class="space-y-2 text-xs">
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">网孔</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">40–100 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">丝径</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">1.5–5.0 mm</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">卷高</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">0.9–5.0 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">卷长</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">10–25 m</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">表面处理</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">电镀 / 热镀 / 包塑 / 预涂塑</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between">
              <dt class="text-theme-muted">标准</dt>
              <dd class="text-theme-primary">ASTM A392<br/>ISO 7987</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <!-- Related Products -->
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">相关产品</p>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-theme-primary mb-3">相关产品</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/wire-mesh-fence-panels/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 网片围栏
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/hexagonal-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 六角网
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/zh/products/welded-wire-mesh/" class="text-theme-secondary hover:text-theme-accent transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-theme-accent">→</span> 焊接网
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>